```Title: PDF Reader Spawning a Shell or Script Host (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1203 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 4c2f1e5d-e475-47f8-823d-e60eb809fb0e```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: PDF forms or plug-ins that launch scripts by design (rare)```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(ParentImage IN ("*\\AcroRd32.exe", "*\\Acrobat.exe", "*\\FoxitPDFReader.exe", "*\\FoxitReader.exe") Image IN ("*\\cmd.exe", "*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\wscript.exe", "*\\cscript.exe", "*\\mshta.exe", "*\\rundll32.exe", "*\\regsvr32.exe"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
